description	"Darth Malak

A tanky Sith Juggernaut duelist thats hard to put down.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- Lightsaber (Purple/Cyan)
-- Saber/Blaster Defense (3)
-- Blaster Deflect (2)
-- 25% less Purple/8% more Cyan damage
-- 25% more special damage
-- 15% longer
-- 10% thinner
-- EX Saber Throw (3) ^3[CS1]
-- BP Free Jumps
--- 33% more damage

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (2)
- Push (3)
- Lightning (1)
-- 100%+ Damage/Cripples
- Dark Rage (2)
- Grip (2)
- Drain (2)
- Stasis (2)

^8Attributes:
- 25% less knockback taken
- Force Block/Focus (2)
- Beskar (1)
- Melee Resist
- Strength (1)
- Blast Armor
- Environmental Protection (1)
- Cortosis (1)
- Healing Regen (Capped at 35)"